---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About | {SITE_TITLE}" description="Learn more about Alexander Perocho" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About Me</h1>
			
			<p style="font-size: 1.125rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
				I'm Alexander Perocho, a Software Engineer at S&P Global Mobility and an aspiring software/AI architect.
			</p>

			<h2>What I Do</h2>
			<p>
				I'm currently an SWE intern on the ML/AI Operations team at S&P Global Mobility, where I work with cloud infrastructure and DevOps at scale. 
				I spend most of my time designing systems and architecting solutions—which I find far more engaging than just writing code.
			</p>

			<h2>Tech Stack</h2>
			<p>
				My bread and butter is <strong>AWS and Kubernetes</strong>. I work extensively with EC2, EKS, DynamoDB, S3, IAM, ECR, and CodeArtifact. 
				I've designed and set up our team's observability stack with Loki, Grafana, Tempo, and Mimir in a multi-tenant architecture. 
				I use <strong>Python</strong> for creating custom services and scripting with boto3, and spend a lot of time with <strong>shell scripting</strong> from the terminal using Ghostty and Neovim.
			</p>
			<p>
				Beyond infrastructure, I work with Kubernetes orchestration, RBAC via OIDC, GitLab, Jira, and Confluence for team collaboration and project management.
			</p>

			<h2>Education</h2>
			<p>
				I studied Computer Science at Western University.
			</p>

			<h2>Outside of Work</h2>
			<p>
				I'm someone who values a healthy lifestyle. I'm an avid runner—currently training for my first full marathon—and a competitive cross-country mountain biker. 
				I've competed in events like the 24 Hours of Summer Solstice in Ontario and continue to explore the sport.
			</p>
			<p>
				I grew up as a competitive swimmer and still enjoy time in the water. I'm passionate about the outdoors—I've hiked the entire Bruce Trail with my family, 
				and we make annual camping trips to crown land. When I'm not outside, you might find me playing music or singing (though I wouldn't call myself good at it!).
			</p>

			<h2>Let's Connect</h2>
			<p>
				If you'd like to discuss system design, cloud architecture, or anything else, feel free to reach out. Check out my blog and projects, or connect with me directly.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
